What Are Dewaxing Catalysts?
Dewaxing catalysts represent sophisticated refinery solutions engineered to transform waxy hydrocarbon streams into premium-grade products. These specialized catalyst systems tackle wax crystallization through selective isomerization or cracking processes - modifying molecular structures to enhance cold flow properties without sacrificing yield. Key performance metrics include cloud point reduction, pour point improvement, and cold filter plugging point optimization, all critical for modern fuel formulations.
